Package: RmetINIA
Type: Package
Title: Access the INIA Uruguay Agroclimatic Data Bank (GRAS)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joaquin", "Peraza", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "joaquin@peraza.uy"),
    person("Instituto Nacional de Investigacion Agropecuaria (INIA), Unidad GRAS",
           role = c("cph", "dtc"),
           comment = "Source and copyright holder of the agroclimatic data and of the station/variable catalogue reproduced by this package")
    )
Description: Download daily agroclimatic observations and summary statistics
    from the Banco de Datos Agroclimatico of INIA Uruguay
    (Instituto Nacional de Investigacion Agropecuaria), served by the GRAS
    unit at <https://gras.inia.uy>. Provides a tidy interface over the public
    CSV export endpoint, with built-in catalogues of the six INIA weather
    stations and the 53 available variables so that station and variable
    identifiers can be discovered and auto-completed from R instead of being
    looked up on the web form. The MIT licence covers the R code only. The
    data retrieved, and the station and variable catalogue reproduced here,
    belong to INIA and are governed by the GRAS terms of use, which require
    that the GRAS website be cited explicitly as the source in any
    publication, presentation or website, and which prohibit commercial
    resale or modified redistribution without prior authorisation from INIA.
    Call inia_terms() for the terms in full. INIA accepts no liability for
    errors or defects in the data, nor for any action taken or omitted on the
    basis of it.
